repository-code: "https://github.com/aman-hanspal/towards-reliable-text-based-video-search"
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen search words, VLM test sets, VLM answers, hand checks and all scores for an evaluation of
  YOLO-World v2 for single-word video search on OVT-B, with a Qwen3-VL 2B verification step, on a 4 GB laptop GPU.
keywords:
  - open-vocabulary object detection
  - video search
  - false positives
  - vision-language models
  - YOLO-World
  - OVT-B
